  "foaf:name": "Accelerating the delivery of SDG14 in Asia and the Pacific",
  "sdo:name": "Accelerating the delivery of SDG14 in Asia and the Pacific",
  "sdo:description": "This Regional Decade Program will support member States to accelerate actions to implement the 2030 Agenda and to reach SDG14 by 2030. The Decade Program will promote the protection and safeguarding of ecosystems health, including marine ecosystems and their interconnectedness with land ecosystems from a one-health approach. In order to achieve this, this Decade Program is envisaged as a concrete plan with specific actions that can enable and prompt the sustainable use and conservation of the ocean and marine ecosystems. These activities will address Decade Challenges 1,2,5,6 and 10.",
  "sdo:location": "Thailand",
  "sdo:identifier": "UN32",
  "sdo:url": "https://oceandecade.org/actions/Accelerating-the-delivery-of-SDG14-in-Asia-and-the-Pacific/",
